# Deploys upload the monorepo root; exclude apps not needed by the frontend/website
# builds to keep uploads small. Do NOT ignore frontend/ or shared/ — the frontend
# Vercel project builds frontend (which depends on @shared/core) from this root.
# Do NOT ignore backend/ either: a Vercel project builds it too (backend/vercel.json),
# and this file applies to every project deployed from this repository.
mobile/
contracts/
**/.next/
**/dist/
**/.turbo/
**/coverage/
**/*.log
